    {id: "agent-session", kind: "cloud-session", installs: ["bundle", "mise"], prefix: "/opt/hyperpolymath/provers", execute-downloaded: "policy", container-runtime: "none", report: ["session .session/ capture", "boj-server"], notes: "network and execution policy differ per session class; measure, never assume", measured: [{date: "2026-11-04", network-policy: "not recorded on the day; not Unrestricted, per the owner (2026-11-12)", platform: "Ubuntu 24.04.5 x86_64 glibc 2.39", hosts-file: "hosts.txt (24 URLs, every one probed twice: HEAD, then --get with a one-byte ranged GET capped at 64 KiB)", reachable: ["github.com release asset (HEAD 302 to release-assets.githubusercontent.com then 200; GET bytes 0-0 206)", "codeload.github.com (GET range-ignored: answers 200 with the whole archive, capped)", "raw.githubusercontent.com", "opam.ocaml.org", "alire.ada.dev", "hackage.haskell.org", "static.rust-lang.org", "index.crates.io (Cargo's sparse index)", "static.crates.io/crates/just/1.56.0/download (the route Cargo downloads from; GET range-ignored, capped)", "releases.lean-lang.org", "mizar.uwb.edu.pl", "pvs.csl.sri.com", "cvc5.github.io", "downloads.sourceforge.net (SBCL binary)", "ftp.gnu.org", "smt-lib.org", "www.tptp.org (GET range-ignored, capped)"], intermittent: ["isabelle.in.tum.de (HEAD 200; GET 206 on 1 of 4 tries, the rest reset during the TLS handshake, curl exit 35)"], refused: ["github.com release landing page (/releases/latest; HEAD and GET 403)", "api.github.com (HEAD and GET 403)", "crates.io/api (HEAD and GET 403; Cargo does not use it to install)"], registry-answered: ["ghcr.io (HEAD 405, GET 401)", "cgr.dev (HEAD 405, GET 401)"], tls-failed: ["www.cs.utexas.edu (HEAD and GET)"], execute-downloaded: "denied-before-download", execute-downloaded-note: "the 2026-10-27 Z3 install experiment was refused by session policy before any bytes moved; whether a fetched binary would run was not observed. One-byte GETs show asset bytes can flow, not that a full download or a run is permitted. On 2026-11-04 the Mizar distribution was downloaded and inspected with file(1) without being run"}, {date: "2026-11-12", network-policy: "Unrestricted (the owner's Default environment; the 2026-11-04 block was taken under a narrower policy)", platform: "Ubuntu 24.04.5 x86_64 glibc 2.39, curl 8.5.0", hosts-file: "hosts.txt at 4d7adbd (24 URLs, each probed once with HEAD at 18:39:58Z and once with --get at 18:40:09Z)", reachable: ["github.com release asset (HEAD 200 after redirects; GET 206)", "codeload.github.com (GET range-ignored, capped)", "raw.githubusercontent.com", "opam.ocaml.org", "alire.ada.dev", "hackage.haskell.org", "static.rust-lang.org", "index.crates.io", "static.crates.io/crates/just/1.56.0/download (GET range-ignored, capped)", "releases.lean-lang.org", "ftp.gnu.org (GET 200: range ignored, body under the cap)", "bordeaux.guix.gnu.org and ci.guix.gnu.org (nix-cache-info; HEAD and GET 200, probed separately at 18:44Z and added to hosts.txt after the main run)", "release-assets.githubusercontent.com (the redirect target of every release download probed; traced with curl -I -L)", "isabelle.in.tum.de (HEAD 200, GET 206 on the one try made)", "mizar.uwb.edu.pl", "pvs.csl.sri.com", "cvc5.github.io", "downloads.sourceforge.net (SBCL binary)", "smt-lib.org", "www.tptp.org (GET range-ignored, capped)"], refused: ["github.com release landing page (/releases/latest; HEAD and GET 403)", "api.github.com (HEAD and GET 403)", "crates.io/api (HEAD and GET 403)"], registry-answered: ["ghcr.io (HEAD 405, GET 401)", "cgr.dev (HEAD 405, GET 401)"], tls-failed: ["www.cs.utexas.edu (HEAD and GET)"], reading: "Unrestricted does not mean every path answers: the agent proxy still refused the three discovery paths it refused on 2026-11-04, so the lock must keep carrying concrete asset URLs. Isabelle answered GET once here; one try does not clear its 2026-11-04 intermittency", execute-downloaded-note: "no download-and-run attempt was made on 2026-11-12, so execute-downloaded is not recorded for this instance"}]},
